@node API Reference
@chapter API Reference

This manual teaches the model and walks through examples.  The reference
for every function, with its exact prototype, arguments, return value
and error codes, is in the manual pages, installed by @command{make
install} and read with @command{man}.  They are the authoritative
description of the API.

@section Overview pages

@table @code
@item dtfl(7)
the library overview: conventions, the error model, the thread-safety
summary, and the list of related pages.
@item dtfl_embedding(7)
the embedding contract: the four host hooks and the PostgreSQL mapping
(@pxref{Embedding}).
@end table

